          <p class="mt-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-v6-text-muted">HubSpot's AEO API is in public beta. We use what it returns, add the reporting choices you set, and say plainly when something is not available.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-3">
          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-v6-border bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-v6-dark">Pulled from HubSpot</h3><ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 text-v6-text-muted marker:text-v6-copper"><li>Tracked prompt text and creation time</li><li>Language and buying-journey phase</li><li>AI engine, run status, and dates</li><li>AI response text</li><li>Citation URLs, titles, and search queries</li><li>Owned and competitor mention counts</li><li>Recommendations and their rationale</li></ul></article>
          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-v6-border bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-v6-dark">Added by you</h3><ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 text-v6-text-muted marker:text-v6-copper"><li>The period and comparison that matter</li><li>Your owned domains and named competitors</li><li>The client-facing topics and prompt groups</li><li>Owners, due dates, and review status</li><li>The findings worth putting in the deck</li></ul></article>
          <article class="rounded-2xl border border-v6-border bg-white p-6"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-v6-dark">Built up over time</h3><ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-3 pl-5 text-v6-text-muted marker:text-v6-copper"><li>Consistent weekly or monthly cutoffs</li><li>Like-for-like comparisons</li><li>Changes after prompt or competitor updates</li><li>Progress on earlier recommendations</li></ul></article>
        </div>
        <p class="mt-8 rounded-xl border border-v6-copper-200 bg-v6-copper-50 px-5 py-4 text-center font-semibold leading-relaxed text-v6-copper-800">If the data is not there, the report says so. It will not turn a missing value into zero or dress up a calculation as a native HubSpot metric.</p>
